{% comment %}
  Hand-drawn arrow (scrapbook language). One shape, drawn pointing to the
  lower-right (head at the end of the curve); aim it per-instance with a CSS
  rotation on the wrapper. Decorative only.
  Accepts: class {String}; variant is accepted for call-site compatibility
  but the shape is intentionally singular so rotations stay predictable.
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="smooch-doodle-arrow {{ class }}" aria-hidden="true">
